ot.png", "id": "4404667079758017", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303746_4404667083091350_4140445348785492288_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xXYqjIQlq6UQ7kNvwG9_O43&_nc_oc=Adps9RTV2hVLp-A05GgN2YW6qXanjdECn3GAGJNn_VxqP9xmyT_WqiAYuAZtIr7EA9g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKuMYfIBqysqIZgUs5_ty4PnIZZzj0s3Fu_IW9Wwp0OVw&oe=6A9EC22F"}, {"file_name": "screenshot1.png", "id": "759602579839087", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499308164_759602583172420_2475078145938702107_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GO8G7ozhW4EQ7kNvwEZc6Ot&_nc_oc=AdpmPMOTETD-f2Dcax1VJF6QbO_xqW0FmS-zY-ZuPBhTB58jw1DoWt53F7wdcAZ80Xo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKulQbQzUEbq4z93ELLblagyLNvXYBMDlakcnpS_fURBA&oe=6A9EDB35"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "new_poster2560x1440_no_text.png", "id": "1919557888817794", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303760_1919557892151127_4609635479397740155_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fEUUR1dDAB4Q7kNvwGGQ1f5&_nc_oc=AdoGewXgYFOi-tOVoZ4zUns2ukNKW7i4EBy37hBO9Q0EsfGElD_vzyInTk9jYYJRvKk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJ5QXaeyoFCMU0P3Ky4KkT-tHs24OPWNALjwouFvJVZ5Q&oe=6A9EB9C3"}, "display_name": "escape-from-x", "keywords": ["survival", "action", "military", "FPS"], "long_description": "This is NOT another extraction shooter.\n\nESCAPE FROM X is a milsim co-op tactical simulator where every raid is a fresh Zero-to-Hero journey.\n\nNOTE: Co-op coming soon!\n\n# \ud83d\udcac JOIN THE COMMUNITY\n\nBe part of the development.\nShare your raid stories, suggest new features, and help forge the ultimate VR mil-sim.\n\n\ud83d\udc49 Discord: https://discord.gg/Je33jR5nh\n\n\ud83d\udc49 YouTube :  look for @BadjoEntertainment  showcasing every feature in action\n\nYou find weapons, silencers, backpacks, and the Hero Key through real storytelling moments.\n{2847820818886321}\n\nThis is not about hoarding loot. Starting Glock \u2013 Zero to Hero in every single raid.\n{1236296688575607}\n\nIt\u2019s about developing real skills: movement under fire, threat detection, recoil control, smart positioning, and split-second decisions.\n{24646184375082887}\n\nNOTE: ESCAPE FROM X is currently in Early Access Beta. Thanks for riding with us.\n{967005402397457}\n\nWHAT MAKES ESCAPE-FROM-X UNIQUE:\n\u2022 No Floating Menus \u2013 Full immersion from the first second.\n{1344307120683939}\n\n\u2022 Real NPC Body Physics \u2013 Push enemies to the ground with your hands, shoot their legs to slow them down and buy time.\n{702870042245024}\n{1499559567859854}\n\n\u2022 Follow the Clues \u2013 Uncover the bigger story one Polaroid at a time.\n{1953303741909990}\n\n\u2022 Have fun while building real skills. This is Virtual Reality.\n{911466928590633}\n\nCOMPETE & PROGRESS\n\u2022 Treasure Hunter Leaderboard \u2013 Collect rare items\n\u2022 Kill Leaderboard \u2013 Pure shooting skill\n\u2022 Hardcore Leaderboard \u2013 For the real operators\n\nEvery map location offers different gear routes, giving you high replayability and multiple ways to approach each raid.\n{854137890328340}\n\n\ud83d\udc80 All About Shooting \u2013 Feel the chaos.\nWelcome to ESCAPE FROM X.", "short_description": "This is NOT another extraction shooter.\n\nESCAPE FROM X is a milsim co-op tactical simulator where every raid is a fresh Zero-to-Hero journey.\n\nNOTE: Co-op coming soon!\n\n# \ud83d\udcac JOIN THE COMMUNITY\n\nBe part of the development.\nShare your raid stories, suggest new features, and help forge the ultimate VR mil-sim.\n\n\ud83d\udc49 Discord: https://discord.gg/Je33jR5nh\n\n\ud83d\udc49 YouTube :  look for @BadjoEntertainment  showcasing every feature in action"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://badjoentertainment.com/efx/Privacy%20Policy.html", "developer_terms_of_se